        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="prod_text" value="Production Components and Governance:&#10;• Production VPC (10.82.0.0/16) [D04]: application, telemetry, and datastore tiers with private VPC interface endpoints.&#10;• S3 State Bucket (aroma-pdn-tfstate) [D02]: native S3 object locking; KMS state key; accessible only via CI/CD OIDC role.&#10;• GitHub OIDC Federation [D06]: per-environment role pdn-apply with zero static AWS credentials (ADR-003).&#10;• Cognito User Pools [D06]: staff (MFA TOTP) for operators/agronomists; field (passwordless SMS) for farmers/transporters.&#10;• Device Registry [D06, D09]: AWS IoT Core X.509 device certificates for farm nodes and certified drone pilots.&#10;• Data Stores: Telemetry DynamoDB table (5-year retention, KMS key) [D09] &amp; S3 Drone Object Bucket (pdn-drone-objects).&#10;• Application Audit Log Group (/aws/application/audit): records sack reads &amp; threshold changes (365d local retention).&#10;• Cross-Account Streaming: CloudWatch Logs subscription filter forwards audit logs to Firehose in Security Account.&#10;• IoT Core Logs (AWSIotLogsV2): logs rejected connection and publication attempts at ERROR level." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#fde047;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="855" y="915" width="1435" height="255" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
