        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qa_text" value="Test Account Components:&#10;• The Pattern Environment: qa is the test environment coded in Epic 6.&#10;• QA VPC (10.81.0.0/16) [D04] with subnets matching the addressing plan.&#10;• S3 State Bucket (aroma-qa-tfstate) [D02] with native object locking.&#10;• GitHub OIDC Federation [D06]: qa-plan and qa-apply IAM roles.&#10;• Test Instances: Cognito User Pools, IoT Core, and test Lambda functions.&#10;• Audit Logs: Local CloudWatch log group (operational testing only);&#10;  records are NOT archived to Security account (ASM-068).&#10;• Boundary Rule: Strictly isolated from production; holds NO production data." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2370" y="860" width="675" height="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev_acct" value="Development Account (dev | 10.80.0.0/16 | Environment: dev | ASM-006)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1e293b;fontSize=13.5;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
