        <mxCell id="trace_box" value="Shared Resource Usage-Based Cost Allocation Formula (ASM-065):&#10;Cost of Entity (e) = Monthly Cost of Shared Resource Family x (Usage Units of e in Month / Total Units in Month)&#10;• Telemetry &amp; Thresholds (farms): Usage = accepted readings per farm (telemetry DynamoDB store).&#10;• Drone Ingress &amp; S3 Storage (drones): Usage = flight objects and stored bytes per farm and campaign (S3 prefixes).&#10;• Transporter Position Store (trips): Usage = position tracking messages per trip.&#10;• Public Lookup &amp; Sack Store (shared -&gt; farms): Usage = sack reads per farm of origin (application audit log).&#10;• Network Hub &amp; TGW (collection-centers): Direct tags where per-center; shared hub cost split equally (1/3 each).&#10;&#10;Diagram Box Badges Catalog (docs/architecture.md Section 14 Traceability to IaC):&#10;• [D02]: S3 remote state bucket per environment with native object locking (B02)&#10;• [D03]: Per-environment configuration, secrets management, and common_tags (B03)&#10;• [D04]: VPC boundaries, tiers, and private endpoints of pattern environment (B04)&#10;• [D06]: IAM Identity Center, Cognito User Pools, GitHub OIDC, and KMS keys (B06)&#10;• [D09]: Telemetry ingestion pattern module, IoT topic rule &amp; DynamoDB store (B09)&#10;&#10;Key Decision Log Citations:&#10;ASM-060 (Management acct), ASM-061 (Direct Org, no Control Tower), ASM-062 (OU-level SCPs),&#10;ASM-063 (Shared env tag), ASM-064 (CostCenter values &amp; testing scope), ASM-065 (Shared cost formula),&#10;ASM-066 (Budget alert thresholds), ASM-067 (5-year Object Lock retention), ASM-068 (Dev/QA audit logs not archived),&#10;ASM-069 (Anonymous public sack audit), ADR-001 (us-east-1, Azure prepared), ADR-002 (Combined flight mode), ADR-003 (OIDC, state buckets)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2350" y="2090" width="1465" height="470" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
